<Slide style={{
  width: '1280px', height: '720px',
  background: '#FAF7F2', padding: '40px 60px 20px',
  flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
  {/* A 标题区 */}
  <Box style={{ marginBottom: 12 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 4 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#1A7F5C', borderRadius: 6, padding: '4px 10px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#fff' }}>牌型识别</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>第二章 · 组合秘籍</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2B2B2B' }}>
      <span style={{ color: '#1A7F5C' }}>四人抬轿</span> vs <span style={{ color: '#8B1A1A' }}>7张无听</span>
    </Text>
  </Box>
  {/* B 内容区 - 上下分栏 */}
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 500, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
    {/* 上：四人抬轿 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFEF8', borderRadius: 16, padding: 20, border: '1px solid #c3e6d3', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 3, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ background: '#1A7F5C', borderRadius: 6, padding: '4px 10px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#fff' }}>四人抬轿 ✅ 好牌型</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A7F5C' }}>7张牌 · 含1-3对子 · 进一张就听牌</Text>
        </Box>
        <svg width={580} height={70} viewBox="0 0 580 70">
          {/* 对子：33万 */}
          <rect x="10" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="2" />
          <text x="34" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">3</text>
          <text x="34" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          <rect x="62" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="2" />
          <text x="86" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">3</text>
          <text x="86" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          {/* 对子：55条 */}
          <rect x="130" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="2" />
          <text x="154" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">5</text>
          <text x="154" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          <rect x="182" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="2" />
          <text x="206" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">5</text>
          <text x="206" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          {/* 散张：2万 7条 9筒 */}
          <rect x="250" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#C9A227" strokeWidth="2" />
          <text x="274" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">2</text>
          <text x="274" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          <rect x="320" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#C9A227" strokeWidth="2" />
          <text x="344" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">7</text>
          <text x="344" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          <rect x="390" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#C9A227" strokeWidth="2" />
          <text x="414" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">9</text>
          <text x="414" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
          {/* 箭头+进张 */}
          <text x="460" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fill="#8B1A1A">→</text>
          <rect x="480" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#8B1A1A" strokeWidth="2.5" strokeDasharray="4" />
          <text x="504" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#8B1A1A">?</text>
          <text x="504" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#8B1A1A">进一张</text>
          <text x="556" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="14" fill="#1A7F5C" fontWeight="bold">就听牌!</text>
        </svg>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4a4038', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          有对子（33万、55条）+ 强连接散张（2万能组123/234，7条能组567/678/789）→ <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A7F5C' }}>进任何一张有用的牌就听牌</span>，听牌概率非常大
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    {/* 下：7张无听 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFEF8', borderRadius: 16, padding: 20, border: '1px solid #f5d5c5', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 3, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ background: '#8B1A1A', borderRadius: 6, padding: '4px 10px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#fff' }}>7张无听 ⚠️ 需调整</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B1A1A' }}>7张牌 · 无对子 · 一张不够</Text>
        </Box>
        <svg width={580} height={70} viewBox="0 0 580 70">
          {/* 全散张：345万 678条 9筒 */}
          <rect x="10" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="34" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">3</text>
          <text x="34" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          <rect x="62" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="86" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">4</text>
          <text x="86" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          <rect x="114" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="138" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">5</text>
          <text x="138" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          <rect x="180" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="204" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">6</text>
          <text x="204" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          <rect x="232" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="256" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">7</text>
          <text x="256" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          <rect x="284" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="308" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">8</text>
          <text x="308" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          <rect x="350" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="374" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">9</text>
          <text x="374" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
          <text x="420" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fill='#8B1A1A'>→</text>
          <rect x="440" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill='#FAF5EC' stroke='#D8CBB4' strokeWidth="1.5" strokeDasharray="4" />
          <text x="464" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#B8A98C">?</text>
          <text x="464" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#B8A98C">还得找将</text>
          <text x="516" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="14" fill="#8B1A1A" fontWeight="bold">差太远!</text>
        </svg>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4a4038', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          没有对子（将牌），进一张不够 → 需要"<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B1A1A' }}>找将</span>"才能听牌。形成秘籍：8张时<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C9A227' }}>打掉对子的挨张</span>（紧邻对子的牌）来简化结构
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    {/* 底部：术语解释 */}
    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(201,162,39,0.08)', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, border: '1px solid #e8d8a8' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4a4038', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C9A227' }}>什么是"挨张"？</span> 如果你手里有对子 55万，那 4万 和 6万 就是 55万的"挨张"（紧挨着的邻居）。8张时打掉一个挨张 = 把"55+4 的三面可能性"简化成"纯55对子"，让牌型更清晰，更容易走向7张无听。图形应朝简单化方向走——<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>能分解成四人抬轿就不要分解成7张无听</span>。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  {/* C 页脚 */}
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'flex-end', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#a0a0a0' }}>09 / 16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
